OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over crash that killed
OL,4,Atwo women
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after two women
OL,7,Fdied in a crash that also left a
OL,8,Fnine-year-old boy with life-changing
OL,9,Finjuries.
OL,11,FAmie Pearson, 26, and Chelsea Carlisle,
OL,12,F29, were travelling in a Suzuki Alto
OL,13,Fwith the boy when it was involved in a
OL,14,Fcrash with a Vauxhall Meriva in
OL,15,FPleasley, on the
OL,16,FDerbyshire-Nottinghamshire border, at
OL,17,Fabout 06:20 GMT on 27 November.
OL,19,FA passenger in the Vauxhall also
OL,20,Fsuffered serious injuries, police said.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
