OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over crash that killed
OL,4,Atwo women
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Emmanuel Chinyanga was
OL,7,Fcharged with two counts of causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving, two counts
OL,9,Fof causing serious injury by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving, two counts of causing death by
OL,11,Fdriving while unlicensed, and two
OL,12,Fcounts of causing death by driving
OL,13,Fwhile uninsured.
